# Frontend UI

- Use semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, `text-warning` — no ad-hoc palette classes (e.g. `bg-blue-500`).
- Font: Noto Sans TC via root layout; `lang="zh-HK"`.
- MVP routes: `/`, `/legal/disclaimer`, `/report/[fingerprint]`; core API `/api/search` (when built).
- Every interactive flow: loading / error / empty states; mobile-first (`min-h-11` tap targets).
- Grades A–F: always show letter + text; do not rely on color alone.
- Copy: Traditional Chinese (HK), calm tone — see `renocheck-product` for legal wording.
- No heavy UI kits in MVP without DEC; prefer Tailwind + small local components.
